cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "NMTF: PPMI versus adjacency input for orthogonal NMTF of a protein interaction network"
abstract: "A small, fully reproducible analysis that factorises a human physical protein-protein interaction network (STRING v12) with orthogonal NMTF, from its random-walk PPMI and from its adjacency matrix, and compares the clusters by GO enrichment and stability across random seeds."
